  "description": "Hayan is a ball-jointed doll displayed as a decoration in a family restaurant. Watching the visitors, she yearns for humanity and desperately wishes to become human herself. Her earnest desire eventually reaches a demon, who makes a contract with her and turns her into a human. On Hayan's first day as a human... the second day... and even as time passes, nothing changes. Men only approach her with ugly desires, seeking to use her body for a single night... Recalling the demon's words that humans are vile creatures, just as she is about to give up on being human, a man appears before her. \n\nA luxury car, tattoos covering his body, and an unusual, intimidating aura emanating from him... This man is different from the men she has met so far. \n\nCould he be a dangerous person?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/dark_fairy_tale)",
